# MG5_aMC@NLO process card for inclusive top pair production

## Collision energy (in GeV)
sqrt_s = 13000 

## Process definition
p p > t t~

## Model information 
model = sm

## Couplings and parameters of the model can be set here.
# No specific changes needed for this standard SM process.

